#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:1
msgid "Constrained Optimization"
msgstr "制約付き最適化"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:3
msgid "Solve a problem with constraints on the design variables using `saealib`."
msgstr "設計変数に制約がある問題を、`saealib`で解きます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:5
msgid ""
"Switching algorithms, surrogates, and the evaluation strategy works the "
"same as in \"Switching components\" in [Single-Objective "
"Optimization](single_objective.md)."
msgstr "アルゴリズム、サロゲート、評価戦略の切り替え方は[単目的最適化](single_objective.md)の「コンポーネントの切り替え」と共通です。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:7
msgid "Problem setup"
msgstr "問題設定"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:9
msgid ""
"Assume a problem that, in addition to the objective function, has an "
"inequality constraint `g(x) <= 0` that the solution must satisfy."
msgstr "目的関数に加えて、解が満たすべき不等式制約`g(x) <= 0`を持つ問題を想定します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:29
msgid "Only solutions satisfying `g1(x) <= 0` are feasible."
msgstr "`g1(x) <= 0`を満たす解だけが実行可能解です。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:31
msgid "Defining constraints"
msgstr "制約の定義"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:33
msgid ""
"A constraint is defined with `InequalityConstraint(func, threshold=0.0)` "
"and passed to `Problem`'s `constraints` argument."
msgstr "制約は`InequalityConstraint(func, threshold=0.0)`で定義し、`Problem`の`constraints`引数に渡します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:55
msgid ""
"To impose a constraint of the form `g(x) >= threshold`, pass `func` with "
"its sign flipped."
msgstr "`g(x) >= threshold`の形で制約を課したい場合は、`func`の符号を反転させて渡します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:57
msgid ""
"For an equality constraint `h(x) = 0`, use `EqualityConstraint(func, "
"tolerance=1e-6)` instead of combining two sign-flipped "
"`InequalityConstraint`s."
msgstr "等式制約`h(x) = 0`は、`InequalityConstraint`を符号反転で組み合わせる代わりに`EqualityConstraint(func, tolerance=1e-6)`を使います。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:71
msgid ""
"`EqualityConstraint` treats solutions satisfying `|h(x)| <= tolerance` as"
" feasible."
msgstr "`EqualityConstraint`は、`|h(x)| <= tolerance`を満たす解を実行可能解として扱います。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:73
msgid "Checking feasibility"
msgstr "実行可能性の確認"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:75
msgid ""
"A solution is feasible if its constraint violation `cv` is at most "
"`Problem`'s `eps_cv` (default `1e-6`)."
msgstr "`Problem`の`eps_cv`（既定値`1e-6`）以下の制約違反量`cv`を持つ解が実行可能解です。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:83
msgid "Customizing with ConstraintHandler"
msgstr "ConstraintHandlerによるカスタマイズ"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:85
msgid ""
"How `cv` is aggregated from multiple constraints, and how feasibility is "
"judged from that value, is decided by `ConstraintHandler`."
msgstr "複数の制約から`cv`を集約する方法と、その値をもとに実行可能性を判定する方法は、`ConstraintHandler`が決めます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:87
msgid ""
"If `Problem`'s `handler` argument is omitted, "
"`StaticToleranceHandler(eps_cv=problem.eps_cv)` is used, which judges "
"feasibility by whether `cv <= eps_cv`."
msgstr "`Problem`の`handler`引数を省略すると、`StaticToleranceHandler(eps_cv=problem.eps_cv)`が使われ、`cv <= eps_cv`かどうかで実行可能性を判定します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "動作"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "`StaticToleranceHandler`"
msgstr "`StaticToleranceHandler`"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "Judges feasibility with a fixed tolerance `eps_cv` (default)"
msgstr "固定の許容誤差`eps_cv`で実行可能性を判定する（既定）"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "`EpsilonConstraintHandler`"
msgstr "`EpsilonConstraintHandler`"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid ""
"Shrinks the tolerance toward 0 over generations, gradually driving "
"solutions into the feasible region"
msgstr "許容誤差を世代とともに0へ近づけ、徐々に実行可能領域へ解を追い込む"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "`GradientRepairHandler`"
msgstr "`GradientRepairHandler`"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md
msgid "Repairs infeasible solutions using the constraint gradient"
msgstr "制約の勾配を使って実行不可能解を修復する"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:95
msgid ""
"`EpsilonConstraintHandler` takes a function that receives the generation "
"number and returns the tolerance."
msgstr "`EpsilonConstraintHandler`には、世代番号を受け取り許容誤差を返す関数を渡します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/constraints.md:118
msgid "References"
msgstr "参照"

